      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "## App Must-Watch + Should-Watch (choose any app)\\n\\n**All apps:** leave **Dashboard filter** empty.\\n**One app:** Dashboard filter \u2192 Tag \u2192 `app` \u2192 pick **any** value (`eip`, `api`, `claims`, \u2026).\\n\\nPrerequisite: tag hosts + services `app:<name>`. Same metrics for every app \u2014 filter only changes scope.\\nMust-watch: Problems, Traffic, Errors, Latency avg/99th, CPU, Memory, Disk.\\nShould-watch: Service/Host honeycombs, GC, Database, External failures."
    },
